  "adaptation_notes": [
    "Use the already migrated DiTBlock with attention_mode=math; its math branch correctly transposes attention heads before merging. The upstream flash branch flattens B,H,N,D as B,N,H*D without transpose; that branch is not used by the new DiT.",
    "New linear patchify/unpatchify, zero-initialized adaLN final layer, fixed-resolution global space-time token stack and strict schema are project-owned after reference search. Swin PatchEmbed has a different windowed image contract and is audit-only.",
    "Reuse owned actor-conditioning and safe bidirectional attention from JointTransition; insert exchanges between DiT blocks instead of an encoder-decoder bottleneck.",
    "Preserve existing reference notices; unresolved OccFM redistribution terms remain in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md."
  ],
